<rml>
<head>
	<title>Connecting</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../rcss/menu.rcss"/>
	<style>
		body {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			background-color: #030303;
			decorator: radial-gradient( circle closest-side at 50% 50%, #5a0a0540 0%, #00000000 100% );
		}
		.dialog { width: 40rem; padding: 2.25rem 3rem 2rem 3rem; }
		.dialog banner { font-size: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
		.server { max-width: 34rem; font-family: OzDisplay; font-size: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; line-height: 1.3;
			text-align: center; color: #fff3e6; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
		.sub { margin-top: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #8d847c; }
		.state { margin-top: 1.5rem; font-family: OzDisplay; font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #e6ddd2; }
		/* endless animations only on a shown page: a hidden one's would keep RmlUi updating it */
		body.shown .state { animation: 0.8s sine-in-out infinite alternate pulse; }
		@keyframes pulse { from { opacity: 1; } to { opacity: 0.6; } }
		.link { display: flex; align-items: center; margin-top: 1rem; padding: 0.375rem 0.875rem; border: 1dp #ffffff1a;
			border-radius: 2dp; background-color: #00000066; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #e6ddd2; }
		.link .dot { width: 0.6rem; height: 0.6rem; margin-right: 0.625rem; border-radius: 0.3rem; background-color: #5ccf4a; }
		.link.relayed .dot { background-color: #ffad33; }
		.dl { width: 100%; margin-top: 1.25rem; }
		.dl .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #8d847c; }
		.dl .top .n { color: #e6ddd2; }
		.dl .track { height: 4dp; margin-top: 0.375rem; border-radius: 2dp; background-color: #ffffff14; }
		.dl .fill { height: 4dp; border-radius: 2dp; background-color: #db2410; }
		.msg { max-width: 34rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.45; text-align: center; color: #ffad33; }
		.foot { margin-top: 1.75rem; }
	</style>
</head>
<!--
The connection screen (P8, ENGINE_PLAN.md decision 21), in place of the game code's connect dialog
(UI_DRAW_CONNECT_SCREEN), under any mod: from the connect to the map's loading. It names the server
(a peer-to-peer match by its listing's name), says where the connection is, shows a download's
progress, what the server said (full, refused) and a peer-to-peer match's link line (direct or
relayed, oz_net_link). Its model, connect, is filled each frame (oz_ui_social.cpp ConnectFrame).
Escape gives up and goes back to the main menu (Menu_Back).
-->
<body data-model="menu">
	<div class="dialog">
		<div class="corners"><div class="tl"/><div class="tr"/><div class="bl"/><div class="br"/></div>
		<banner text="Connecting"/>
		<div class="server"><span>{{ connect.server }}</span></div>
		<div class="sub"><span>{{ connect.sub }}</span></div>
		<div class="link" data-if="connect.link != ''" data-class-relayed="connect.link != 'Direct link to the host'"><span class="dot"/><span>{{ connect.link }}</span></div>
		<div class="state"><span>{{ connect.state }}</span></div>
		<div class="dl" data-if="connect.download.name != ''">
			<div class="top"><span class="n">{{ connect.download.name }}</span><span>{{ connect.download.text }}</span></div>
			<div class="track"><div class="fill" data-style-width="connect.download.pct"/></div>
		</div>
		<div class="msg" data-if="connect.message != ''"><span>{{ connect.message }}</span></div>
		<div class="foot"><div class="backbtn" onclick="back"><kbd>Esc</kbd><span>Cancel</span></div></div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
